WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.000 --> 00:00:02.802
-Welcome to "The Tonight Show."

00:00:02.802 --> 00:00:04.737
Let's get to the news and jokes.

00:00:04.737 --> 00:00:07.474
Well, guys, after spending
four days in the hospital,

00:00:07.474 --> 00:00:09.409
last night,
President Trump arrived

00:00:09.409 --> 00:00:10.710
back at the White House

00:00:10.710 --> 00:00:13.112 line:0%
and it was quite a scene.
Take a look.

00:00:13.112 --> 00:00:15.014 line:0%
-Walking out the doors
of Walter Reed,

00:00:15.014 --> 00:00:17.750 line:0%
boarding Marine One for his
flight back to the White House,

00:00:17.750 --> 00:00:19.486 line:0%
where he marched up the steps.

00:00:19.486 --> 00:00:22.221 line:0%
-And then, the president,
who is still contagious,

00:00:22.221 --> 00:00:24.089 line:0%
did something remarkable.

00:00:24.089 --> 00:00:25.425 line:0%
He took off his mask.

00:00:25.425 --> 00:00:26.493 line:0%
And the president,

00:00:26.493 --> 00:00:28.461 line:0%
who is supposed
to be in isolation,

00:00:28.461 --> 00:00:31.330 line:0%
then walked inside
to a room full of people.

00:00:31.330 --> 00:00:33.299
[ Laughter ]
-Pssh!

00:00:33.299 --> 00:00:35.501
-There's a lot to unpack here.

00:00:35.501 --> 00:00:37.469
First, why would he use
the White House entrance

00:00:37.469 --> 00:00:38.805
with the most stairs?

00:00:38.805 --> 00:00:40.406
[ Laughter ]
I mean,

00:00:40.406 --> 00:00:42.675
I've never seen him climb
those steps in four years.

00:00:42.675 --> 00:00:45.378
I mean, why would he
do that now?

00:00:45.378 --> 00:00:46.812
The Obamas were in perfect shape

00:00:46.812 --> 00:00:48.281
and they never climbed
those steps.

00:00:48.281 --> 00:00:49.649
[ Laughter ]

00:00:49.649 --> 00:00:51.150
Seriously, I'm not sure
it was safe for him

00:00:51.150 --> 00:00:53.453
to climb 22 steps before COVID.

00:00:53.453 --> 00:00:55.155
[ Laughter ]

00:00:55.155 --> 00:00:57.857
It felt like that famous scene
where Rocky climbs up the steps,

00:00:57.857 --> 00:00:59.191
but everyone behind him
is running

00:00:59.191 --> 00:01:01.561
in the opposite direction.

00:01:01.561 --> 00:01:04.297
[ Laughter ]
♪ Bene womp! ♪

00:01:04.297 --> 00:01:06.365
♪ Buna -- fleneh wah ♪

00:01:06.365 --> 00:01:08.701
I'm trying to do the reverse --
-The reverse of an A chord?

00:01:08.701 --> 00:01:11.637
[ Laughter ]
-[ Clapping ]

00:01:11.637 --> 00:01:13.005
♪ Wanah wonk ♪

00:01:13.005 --> 00:01:14.339
-No, no.
-No?

00:01:14.339 --> 00:01:15.909
-1.8 million, no, no, no.

00:01:15.909 --> 00:01:17.077
[ Laughter ]

00:01:17.077 --> 00:01:18.511
-Good for him.
He made it to the top,

00:01:18.511 --> 00:01:20.280
where he was greeted
by some staffers

00:01:20.280 --> 00:01:21.915
showing off their best,
"Oh, my God.

00:01:21.915 --> 00:01:23.416
We're so glad you're back" face.

00:01:23.416 --> 00:01:24.650
[ Laughter ]

00:01:24.650 --> 00:01:27.219
Then, the big reveal
atop the balcony,

00:01:27.219 --> 00:01:29.222
he took off his mask

00:01:29.222 --> 00:01:30.456
and you could almost hear
him being like...

00:01:30.456 --> 00:01:31.791
[ As Trump ]
Ta-da!

00:01:31.791 --> 00:01:33.092
And, now, for my next trick,

00:01:33.092 --> 00:01:35.261
I will make everyone
in the White House disappear.

00:01:35.261 --> 00:01:37.397
[ Laughter ]

00:01:37.397 --> 00:01:39.164
Trump pulled off that mask
like he was revealing

00:01:39.164 --> 00:01:42.135
that he'd been his
twin brother the whole time.

00:01:42.135 --> 00:01:44.637
[ Changes accent ]
You fools, it was me, Ronald!

00:01:44.637 --> 00:01:45.972
[ Laughter ]

00:01:45.972 --> 00:01:48.241
The entire time.

00:01:48.241 --> 00:01:50.343
That's the craziest thing
he's ever done on that balcony,

00:01:50.343 --> 00:01:51.744
and that's the same place
where he looked

00:01:51.744 --> 00:01:53.379
straight into an eclipse.

00:01:53.379 --> 00:01:56.115
[ Laughter ]

00:01:56.115 --> 00:01:58.484
If you're worried Trump didn't
use that mask again, don't be.

00:01:58.484 --> 00:02:00.553
He then used it
to turn every doorknob.

00:02:00.553 --> 00:02:02.155
[ As Trump ]
Safety first.

00:02:02.155 --> 00:02:04.023
[ Laughter ]

00:02:04.023 --> 00:02:05.458
Safety first.
Now, you close it.

00:02:05.458 --> 00:02:06.692
Now, you close it.

00:02:06.692 --> 00:02:08.527
[ Laughter ]
-Ew!

00:02:08.527 --> 00:02:09.696
-When he got back
to the White House,

00:02:09.696 --> 00:02:11.464
Trump tweeted a video
where he once again

00:02:11.464 --> 00:02:13.299
downplayed the virus.
Listen to this.

00:02:13.299 --> 00:02:16.135
-I just left
Walter Reed Medical Center

00:02:16.135 --> 00:02:18.972
and it's really
something very special.

00:02:18.972 --> 00:02:22.374
And I learned so much
about coronavirus

00:02:22.374 --> 00:02:24.310
and one thing that's
for certain --

00:02:24.310 --> 00:02:27.346
don't let it dominate you.

00:02:27.346 --> 00:02:29.248
Don't be afraid of it.

00:02:29.248 --> 00:02:30.382
You're going to beat it.

00:02:30.382 --> 00:02:32.418
And I know there's a risk,
there's a danger,

00:02:32.418 --> 00:02:33.853
but that's okay.

00:02:33.853 --> 00:02:36.055
And, now, I'm better
and maybe I'm immune.

00:02:36.055 --> 00:02:37.156
I don't know.

00:02:37.156 --> 00:02:39.024
[ Laughter ]

00:02:39.024 --> 00:02:41.260
[ As Trump ]
I don't know.
Maybe I'm Spider-Man.

00:02:41.260 --> 00:02:44.597
[ Laughter ]
Maybe I have Spidey powers

00:02:44.597 --> 00:02:46.599
and I can climb
up the White House.

00:02:46.599 --> 00:02:48.268
[ Laughter ]

00:02:48.268 --> 00:02:49.869
It feels like that part
of the movie

00:02:49.869 --> 00:02:51.237
where Trump was bitten
by a werewolf

00:02:51.237 --> 00:02:52.672
and plays it off like it's
no big deal. He's like --

00:02:52.672 --> 00:02:54.340
[ As Trump ]
Totally fine.
Never better.

00:02:54.340 --> 00:02:56.675
Sure, I howl at the Moon
and I have a taste for humans,

00:02:56.675 --> 00:02:58.678
but, mostly, a-okay.

00:02:58.678 --> 00:03:00.312
[ Laughter ]

00:03:00.312 --> 00:03:03.650
Trump's still sick and he thinks
he's immune. He's like --

00:03:03.650 --> 00:03:04.717
[ As Trump ]
I just tested negative.

00:03:04.717 --> 00:03:06.352
I just peed on a nasal swab

00:03:06.352 --> 00:03:08.354
five minutes ago, so.
[ Laughter ]

00:03:08.354 --> 00:03:10.456
Could we look into that?

00:03:10.456 --> 00:03:12.759
Also, I'm pretty sure Trump
has become our first

00:03:12.759 --> 00:03:14.760
vlogger-in-chief.
[ Laughter ]

00:03:14.760 --> 00:03:15.761
[ As Trump ]
What's up, fam?

00:03:15.761 --> 00:03:17.897
It's your boy DJ T.

00:03:17.897 --> 00:03:19.899
[ Laughter ]
Just got out of the hospital.

00:03:19.899 --> 00:03:21.267
Feeling hundo p.

00:03:21.267 --> 00:03:23.302
Be sure to like and subscribe
and check out my merch.

00:03:23.302 --> 00:03:25.337
[ Laughter ]

00:03:25.337 --> 00:03:27.640
Well, after all that, Trump is
back in the White House,

00:03:27.640 --> 00:03:29.308
but it's a very
different White House

00:03:29.308 --> 00:03:31.811
than the one he left just a few
days ago. Watch this.

00:03:44.991 --> 00:03:47.260
Yeah, Trump staffers want
to work somewhere safer,

00:03:47.260 --> 00:03:49.996
so they all booked tickets
for a Carnival cruise.

00:03:49.996 --> 00:03:52.865
[ Laughter ]

00:03:52.865 --> 00:03:54.900
That's right, the White House
is practically empty.

00:03:54.900 --> 00:03:56.836
Things are so bad,
today Trump had to write

00:03:56.836 --> 00:03:58.538
a tell-all book about himself.

00:03:58.538 --> 00:04:00.840
[ Laughter ]

00:04:00.840 --> 00:04:02.375
It is not a great scene
over there.

00:04:02.375 --> 00:04:04.343
Tonight Trump was
outside Melania's door,

00:04:04.343 --> 00:04:05.844
whispering
through the keyhole...

00:04:05.844 --> 00:04:07.780
[ As Trump ]
♪ Do you want to build
a snowman? ♪

00:04:07.780 --> 00:04:10.550
[ Laughter ]

00:04:10.550 --> 00:04:12.885
But the White House is
taking some precautions.

00:04:12.885 --> 00:04:15.988
For example, the press briefing
room was thoroughly sanitized.

00:04:15.988 --> 00:04:17.456
Take a look at this.

00:04:17.456 --> 00:04:18.624
There you go, yep.

00:04:18.624 --> 00:04:20.526
Later, that same guy was seen

00:04:20.526 --> 00:04:22.328
spraying Diet Coke directly
into Trump's mouth.

00:04:22.328 --> 00:04:24.897
[ Laughter ]

00:04:24.897 --> 00:04:26.465
As if all this
wasn't crazy enough,

00:04:26.465 --> 00:04:28.901
it now appears that the top
members of the military

00:04:28.901 --> 00:04:30.970
have also been exposed
to the virus.

00:04:30.970 --> 00:04:34.539 line:0%
-All but one member
of the Joint Chiefs of Staff

00:04:34.539 --> 00:04:35.808 line:0%
are now under quarantine,

00:04:35.808 --> 00:04:38.010 line:0%
this after a top
Coast Guard official

00:04:38.010 --> 00:04:40.947 line:0%
tested positive for coronavirus
after visiting...

00:04:40.947 --> 00:04:42.515 line:0%
the White House.
-This is nuts.

00:04:42.515 --> 00:04:45.318
Our top military leaders
are working from home!

00:04:45.318 --> 00:04:46.853
Right now,
there's a four-star general

00:04:46.853 --> 00:04:48.554
getting really
into sourdough bread.

00:04:48.554 --> 00:04:49.989
[ Laughter ]

00:04:49.989 --> 00:04:52.291
It's comforting to know that,
if someone were to attack,

00:04:52.291 --> 00:04:54.227
our officials will be quickly
trying to figure out

00:04:54.227 --> 00:04:55.461
a Zoom link.

00:04:55.461 --> 00:04:57.997
[ Laughter ]

00:04:57.997 --> 00:04:59.198
Let's change gears here.

00:04:59.198 --> 00:05:00.833
I saw that Apple
is now involved

00:05:00.833 --> 00:05:03.035
in a pretty interesting lawsuit.
Listen to this.

00:05:03.035 --> 00:05:04.270 line:0%
-Apple is suing a former

00:05:04.270 --> 00:05:05.705 line:0%
recycling partner in Canada

00:05:05.705 --> 00:05:07.573 line:0%
for allegedly not doing its job.

00:05:07.573 --> 00:05:09.242 line:0%
Apple claims
the recycling company

00:05:09.242 --> 00:05:13.246 line:0%
actually resold more
than 100,000 iPhones, iPads,

00:05:13.246 --> 00:05:16.983 line:0%
and Apple Watches that it
was supposed to destroy.

00:05:16.983 --> 00:05:18.951
-Apple was like, "Hey!
Reselling the same phone

00:05:18.951 --> 00:05:20.319
over and over is our thing."

00:05:20.319 --> 00:05:22.821
[ Laughter ]

00:05:22.821 --> 00:05:24.189
Apparently,
the recycling company

00:05:24.189 --> 00:05:27.059
sold some of the old phones
and then kept the rest

00:05:27.059 --> 00:05:28.828
in a random kitchen drawer,
like everyone else.

00:05:28.828 --> 00:05:30.129
[ Laughter ]

00:05:30.129 --> 00:05:31.531
"This'll be worth
something someday."

00:05:31.531 --> 00:05:32.965
[ Laughter ]

00:05:32.965 --> 00:05:34.867
Listen to this.
Yesterday, Governor Phil Murphy

00:05:34.867 --> 00:05:37.136 line:0%
tweeted that "Halloween is ON"

00:05:37.136 --> 00:05:38.670 line:0%
in New Jersey this year.

00:05:38.670 --> 00:05:40.239
[ Laughing and scoffing ]

00:05:40.239 --> 00:05:41.974
Halloween's very special
in New Jersey.

00:05:41.974 --> 00:05:43.843
It's the first time parents
get to see their kids

00:05:43.843 --> 00:05:46.145
go door-to-door
making "collections."

00:05:46.145 --> 00:05:48.780
[ Laughter ]

00:05:48.780 --> 00:05:49.849
[ Italian accent ]
This is it?

00:05:49.849 --> 00:05:51.283
[ Laughter ]

00:05:51.283 --> 00:05:52.685
I'll be back
for the rest tomorrow,

00:05:52.685 --> 00:05:53.786
and you better have it.

00:05:53.786 --> 00:05:56.288
[ Laughter ]

00:05:56.288 --> 00:05:57.957
Check this out.
I read about a man

00:05:57.957 --> 00:05:59.091
who paid for a billboard

00:05:59.091 --> 00:06:02.261
advertising a date with him
back in January.

00:06:02.261 --> 00:06:03.329
And good news --

00:06:03.329 --> 00:06:04.763
he now has a girlfriend.

00:06:04.763 --> 00:06:06.665
[ Cheering and applause ]
Yeah.

00:06:06.665 --> 00:06:07.900
[ Whistling ]

00:06:07.900 --> 00:06:09.401
Though it got weird today
when there was

00:06:09.401 --> 00:06:12.638
a giant billboard that said...

00:06:12.638 --> 00:06:13.906
[ Laughter ]

00:06:13.906 --> 00:06:16.376
And, finally, a new study
just came out that says...

00:06:18.778 --> 00:06:20.279
...and there's no part
of their brain

00:06:20.279 --> 00:06:21.547
that can tell the difference

00:06:21.547 --> 00:06:24.083
between the front and back
of humans' heads.

00:06:24.083 --> 00:06:25.717
[ Laughter ]
-Hm.

00:06:25.717 --> 00:06:27.352
-Yes, yes, yes, these are

00:06:27.352 --> 00:06:29.488
the scientific breakthroughs
we want right now.

00:06:29.488 --> 00:06:30.890
[ Laughter ]

